            "review_title": "Review at Mano Italian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Gopi\nWinnipeg, Canada1804 contributions\n0\nHighly satisfied\nMar 2026 • Friends\nOn the recommendation of one of my best Sri Lankan friends, I decided to visit Mano Italian Restaurant & Shop for lunch. The occasion was special as my wife and I were meeting a very important family friend, so we were hoping for a pleasant dining experience—and it certainly delivered.\n\nApparently my friend had informed the owner, Manjula, about our visit beforehand. He welcomed us very warmly and graciously, immediately making us feel comfortable and well looked after. He also offered a few thoughtful recommendations and surprised us with a complimentary appetizer to try. It was a lovely gesture that set the tone for the meal and heightened our anticipation for what was to come.\n\nAs vegetarians, my wife and I were grateful for the helpful suggestions we received. We followed his recommendations and every dish turned out to be more than perfect—flavorful, satisfying, and beautifully prepared. Our friend, who hosted us, ordered a few non-vegetarian dishes and mentioned that they were excellent as well.\n\nThe service throughout was attentive without being intrusive, and the food presentation was impressive. Overall, it was a very enjoyable dining experience with great hospitality and delicious food.\n\nI would happily return the next time I’m in Hanoi. Highly recommended! 🍝✨\nRead more\nWritten April 4, 2026",
